# {{non-gloss definition|Full form of the first-person plural pronoun in the accusative case, used as the direct object of a verb}}; [[us#Pronoun|us]].
#: {{usex|Иска ми се Мартин да беше поканил и '''нас'''. |lang=bg|translation=I wish Martin had invited '''us''' as well.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|The first-person plural pronoun in the prepositional case, used as the object of a preposition}}; [[us#Pronoun|us]].
#: {{usex|Повечето от '''нас''' мислят, че предолжението е добро.|lang=bg|translation=Most of '''us''' think that the proposal is a good one.}}

